  "body": "Decision record for #5855 (rendering pipeline & conformance suite, follow-on 7 of parent #5679).\n\nSettles, as a `doc/` record:\n- **Compile/runtime split:** hybrid, compile-time-dominant — parse → validate → compose → lower → emit per target over one target-neutral IR; runtime only binds data/state and instantiates the compiled artefact. Pure-runtime interpretation, fully-static per-target code baking, and per-target source transforms rejected with reasons.\n- **Conformance:** golden corpus with per-target expected outputs — DOM/class expectations for web, control-kind + accessibility-tree expectations for native/GUI; pixel comparison advisory only, never the gate. Coverage rule: every vocabulary element/assertion needs a corpus case.\n- **Tooling/linting:** one linter (errors for unknown kinds/roles, override ties, essential content in conditional blocks; warnings for unmapped assertions — never silent, adopting the build-time-warning branch) and a one-command multi-target preview.\n- Consumes the settled sibling decisions (#5850 vocabulary, #5852 native, #5853 custom GUI, #5854 composition) without re-deciding them; proposes no change to any parent #5679 decision, and states its assumptions against the still-open parent explicitly.\n- Implementation follow-ups filed and linked: #7918 (compiler core), #7919 (conformance corpus/harness), #7920 (author tooling).\n\nDocs-only change; no code or tests touched.\n\nCloses #5855\n\n🤖 Queue task 12832 · lane code-w\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796782432&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7921&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7921&signature=252c1ea70164f9991fbce6ccf7de05dc0a0a09164629e1858ee2f3c403f75c19\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7921?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
